                                :note "Green only when guest serial has GUEST_SESSION_OK restored-front=2 packed=2 kotoba-front=2 hit=2. Hosted kbb -M:compositor wm does not count. Always-front restore is leftover. Native component runtime remains. P5 UNVERIFIED.")]
             (write-guest-session-receipt! receipt)
